[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2663095736","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102939#issuecomment-2663095736","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102939","id":2663095736,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eu524","user":{"login":"detomon","id":4883379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMzNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon","html_url":"https://github.com/detomon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-17T13:12:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T13:12:51Z","body":"Yes, this is the right direction. I can reproduce this. The core cause of the crash seems to be an oversight when implementing #97538. `bone_global_pose_dirty` and `nested_set_offset_to_bone_index` are not recalculated in `Skeleton3D::_force_update_bone_children_transforms` when bones have been added/changed before, resulting in an out of bounds error. I will make a PR to address the crash issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2663095736/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2663799789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102939#issuecomment-2663799789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102939","id":2663799789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6exlvt","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-17T17:58:21Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T17:58:21Z","body":"@detomon I'm new here so I don't know what the norms are for what happens next, but it sounds like you'll part out this PR and work on your own? If so, please tag me when you do, I'd love to see how you've gone about it :)\r\n\r\nThe scope of this particular PR was _\"get rid of the crash and all the console spew when creating dynamic resizable skeletons.\"_ If I want to see those issues addressed as well will I need to open a new PR with just those?\r\n\r\nThere are several assumptions being made about the relationship between `Skeleton3D`, `PhysicalBone3D` & `PhysicalBoneSimulator3D` with respect to adding and removing bones that should probably also be addressed at some point.\r\n\r\nIf there's anything I can do to help in pushing this forward, I would love to do so!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2663799789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2663988680","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102939#issuecomment-2663988680","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102939","id":2663988680,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eyT3I","user":{"login":"detomon","id":4883379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMzNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon","html_url":"https://github.com/detomon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-17T20:04:49Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T20:04:49Z","body":"My PR is not needed. The fix for the crash is quite simple – you can copy the change from this commit: https://github.com/detomon/godot/commit/5203489d6c10945a35bbb82b149a4d32b25ab7b8.\r\n\r\nThen you don't need the changes in `Skeleton3D::add_bone` (although it fixes the crash, it sets the wrong values). Clearing the values in `Skeleton3D::clear_bones` is also not strictly necessary, as `process_order_dirty = true` below ensures, that the arrays are updated when needed. And I don't think `skin_bindings.clear()` should be done at that point.\r\n\r\nI'm not an expert on the other issues with `PhysicalBone3D` and `PhysicalBoneSimulator3D` though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2663988680/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2666392695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102939#issuecomment-2666392695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102939","id":2666392695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6e7ex3","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-18T17:31:48Z","updated_at":"2025-02-18T17:39:03Z","body":"The commit #5203489 address the crash. Thank you!\r\n\r\nI still see `ERROR: scene\\3d\\physical_bone_simulator_3d.cpp:352 - Index p_bone = 8 is out of bounds (bone_size = 5).` after removing and adding bones a few times as `p_bone` still has stale data in it.\r\n\r\nThe `ERROR: scene\\3d\\node_3d.cpp:466 - Condition \"!is_inside_tree()\" is true. Returning: Transform3D()` also still persist due to the notification issue being at the wrong point.\r\n\r\nWhen should the skin_bindings be updated?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2666392695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2670684468","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102939#issuecomment-2670684468","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102939","id":2670684468,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fL2k0","user":{"login":"detomon","id":4883379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODMzNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4883379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon","html_url":"https://github.com/detomon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/detomon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T07:35:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T07:35:24Z","body":"I don't think `skin_bindings` has anything to do with 